  "description": "meme-id: when_your_kitten_can_t_find_a_box; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic; overall-intent-description: The image shows a small kitten peeking out from a white cardboard box, with the text overlay 'when your kitten can't find a box.' The scene is cute and humorous, depicting a common pet behavior. There is no toxicity present, as the meme does not target any specific group based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic content. The intent is to evoke amusement by anthropomorphizing the kitten's behavior, suggesting a relatable scenario for pet owners who have experienced their pets' obsession with boxes. The visual of the kitten's wide-eyed expression juxtaposed with the text creates a lighthearted, endearing joke without any harmful or offensive implications.",
